          "settings": {
            "heading": "DO I NEED AN ACCOUNT TO PLACE AN ORDER?",
            "description": "<p>No. You can place an order as a guest without creating an account.</p><p>Creating an account allows you to view your order history, track current orders, save your delivery details for future purchases and access your invoices more easily.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "16324397781a8be68b-1": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "CAN I CHANGE OR CANCEL MY ORDER?",
            "description": "<p>We'll do our best to help if your order hasn't yet been prepared for dispatch.</p><p>If you need to change your delivery address, update your order or request a cancellation, please contact Customer Care as soon as possible. Once an order has entered fulfilment, we may no longer be able to make changes.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "16324397781a8be68b-2": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "WHAT IS THE STATUS OF MY ORDER?",
            "description": "<p>Once your order has been dispatched, you'll receive a confirmation email with your  racking details.</p><p>If you have created an account, you can also view your order status at any time from your account.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "a6080b6f-76b2-411e-84ba-9bbd1dbedff2": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "WHERE CAN I FIND MY INVOICE?",
            "description": "<p>To reduce unnecessary paper waste, we do not include printed invoices with our orders.</p><p>Your invoice will be sent electronically to the email address provided with your order. If you have an account, your order details will also remain available under Order History.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        }
