          "settings": {
            "heading": "HOW MUCH DOES SHIPPING COST?",
            "description": "<p>Shipping costs vary depending on the delivery destination and order value.</p><p>The applicable shipping cost will be shown at checkout before payment is completed. Where available, free shipping thresholds will be applied automatically.</p>",
