          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "DO YOU ACCEPT RETURNS?",
            "description": "<p>Yes. Eligible products may be returned within 14 days of delivery, in accordance with applicable European consumer legislation.</p><p>Returned items must be unopened, unused and returned in their original condition. Please refer to our Returns policy for full details.</p>",
