      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_EJ7dh9": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "HOW ARE BRANDS SELECTED?",
            "description": "<p>Every brand is selected through our curation process and sourced directly from the brand or its authorised European distributor.</p><p>We look beyond trends and marketing claims, assessing formulation quality, ingredient sourcing, product performance and the principles behind every brand we choose. Many of the brands we partner with manufacture in smaller quantities and carefully manage production at every stage. While this may occasionally affect availability, it helps maintain the quality and integrity of every formula.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_W64YCg": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "WHERE SHOULD I START?",
            "description": "<p>If you're new to Skin Collective, we recommend starting with Understand Your Skin in <a href=\"/blogs/the-skin-edit/understand-your-skin\" title=\"UNDERSTAND YOUR SKIN\"><em>The Skin Edit</em></a><em>.</em></p><p>There, you'll find practical guidance on skin concerns, ingredients and routines to help you make informed choices. If you still need assistance, our Customer Care team will be<br/>happy to help.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        }
      },
