          "settings": {
            "heading": "DO YOU OFFER GIFT CARDS?",
            "description": "<p>Yes. Skin Collective Gift Cards are delivered digitally and include a unique code that can be redeemed at checkout.</p><p>Gift Cards can be used on eligible purchases and any remaining balance will stay available until the full value has been redeemed. If the Gift Card doesn't cover the full order value, the remaining balance can be paid using another payment method.</p>",
