          "settings": {
            "heading": "HOW CAN I CONTACT CUSTOMER CARE?",
            "description": "<p>Our Customer Care team is available Monday to Friday, 10:00 am–6:00 pm (Lisbon time).</p><p>You can contact us via our Contact Form or by email at <a href=\"mailto:contact@skincollectiveco.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:contact@skincollectiveco.com\">contact@skincollectiveco.com</a>.</p><p>We aim to respond within one business day. During busy periods, response times may be slightly longer.</p>",
